  "contracts": [
    "Configured active Push origin/channel permits subscription collection/management on any plan; Pro/Enterprise sending, quota/role-gated custom channel creation, plan-gated Smart Alert setup.",
    "Continue saves a Push channel; saved instructions do not publish/register a worker or create a subscription.",
    "Shopify setup associates channel and pixel; Enable Push opens app embed/theme activation; VTEX domain/pixel setup and HTTPS same-origin worker readiness are prerequisites.",
    "Public business/channel identity versus private token; existing worker/scope/application-key preservation and browser compatibility.",
    "Async SDK initialization starts Push preparation in background; supported HTTPS APIs, explicit subscription click and Response/server acknowledgement versus permission/local state.",
    "Existing enabled business Smart Alert required; actual collection preview inert, unsaved and not delivered/browser permission/automatic stock tracking.",
    "SDK requests enabled section explicitly, no automatic page-type detection; dismissed/denied/subscribed availability and per-business/origin browser dismissal history 7/30 days with page-memory fallback.",
    "Alert accepted records click before permission/server subscription outcome; registration failures/retries cannot prove successful acknowledgement.",
    "Unsubscribe disables server identity before local removal, server failure retains subscription; cancellation does not revoke permission/cancel other devices/remove already delivered notifications; push:false is not unsubscribe.",
    "Authorized isolated test recipient and scope; subscription on non-sending plan versus delivery eligibility; request acceptance/receipt/destination separate.",
    "Only obsolete Setup overview warning sentence removed per locale; original verifier, all other bytes/figures preserved."
